I think it would be better to split ensuring the user and ensuring the grant into two functions then do something like

```
	if err := ensureUser(ctx, c, owner, ...); err != nil {
		return "", err
	}
	if err := ensureGrant(ctx, c, owner, ...); err != nil {
		return "", err
	}
	return nil
```

in EnsureDatabaseUser
